# .gitattributes GOC monorepo (tu HTBB/.gitattributes; web/ va client_jar/ con tep rieng).
# Chuan hoa xuong dong. Quan trong khi deploy len Linux:
# script .sh bi luu kieu CRLF (Windows) thi Linux bao "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M".
* text=auto

*.sh text eol=lf
# File .bat chay tren Windows: PHAI CRLF, cmd.exe co the loi goto/label voi LF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.service text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf

# File cau hinh doc boi ca Windows va Linux: giu LF cho chac
*.ini text eol=lf
# vps/server.ini.tmpl duoc doc bang "read -r" trong sinh-server-ini.sh: neu la CRLF
# thi moi gia tri dinh mot \r o cuoi va di thang vao server.ini.
*.tmpl text eol=lf
*.example text eol=lf

# File du lieu frame cua hieu ung / sprite: KHONG CO DUOI nen khong khop luat nao
# ben duoi, ma "* text=auto" thi git tu do noi dung de doan. Hien tai cac file nay deu
# co byte NUL nen git doan dung la binary, nhung dung dua vao do: file nao khong co NUL
# se bi doi CRLF<->LF luc checkout -> du lieu frame sai do dai -> client doc lech goi 26.
server/map/d_effect/** binary
server/map/sprite_goc/** binary

# Nhi phan - tuyet doi khong duoc chuyen doi xuong dong (se hong file)
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.mid binary
*.zip binary
*.class binary
*.dat binary
